msgid "版本与发布记录"
msgstr "Versions and release history"

msgid ""
"当前版本来自 ``configs/build-version``。本目录归档 ReliefOS 自身的发布说明； 原始正文、标签和源码保存在 `GitHub Releases "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/releases>`_。"
msgstr ""
"The current version comes from ``configs/build-version``. This directory archives ReliefOS release"
" notes; original bodies, tags, and sources are on `GitHub Releases "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/releases>`_."

msgid ""
"历史说明保留发布时的功能范围、迁移要求、验证结果与已知限制，不代表当前 版本状态。旧文档链接固定到对应发布标签，历史命令和路径不作为现行使用指南。 新版本按 "
":doc:`../process/releasing` 归档。"
msgstr ""
"Historical notes preserve features, migration requirements, validation results, and known limits "
"as of release, not current status. Old documentation links are pinned to their release tags; "
"historical commands/paths are not current usage instructions. Archive new versions according to "
":doc:`../process/releasing`."
